WEBVTT

00:00:00.109 --> 00:00:05.005
This video shows how a student views and submits assignments on a phone.

00:00:06.685 --> 00:00:15.301
Tap the menu button and choose Assignments. Every assignment from your teachers is a card with its subject, type and status.

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:31.060
Scroll down to graded work. This card shows your marks and the teacher's feedback.

00:00:36.319 --> 00:00:41.119
A Diary Entry is for reading only, so it has no Submit button.

00:00:45.323 --> 00:00:49.163
For an open assignment, tap Submit on its card.

00:00:56.500 --> 00:01:03.748
Type your answer. Submission Text is required. A link to your file is optional.

00:01:18.475 --> 00:01:26.299
Tap Submit Assignment. A green message at the top of the page confirms it, and the card now shows Submitted.

00:01:43.198 --> 00:01:48.622
Your work is submitted. Your teacher will grade it and add feedback.
